      "description": {
        "fun": "Espurr's blank little face hides a constant struggle: the ring-shaped organs under its folded ears pour out psychic power it can't control, enough to blast everything within 90 metres and send even a wrestler flying. Its big ears are all that keep the energy in, and if too much builds up it can faint. It's a Scottish Fold kitten crossed with the nekomata, a cat spirit that gains powers as its tail splits in two.",
        "guide": "Espurr is a Psychic-type kitten Pokémon from Kalos. Organs beneath its folded ears give off psychic power so strong it can barely contain it, though its expression rarely changes. It evolves into Meowstic, whose look and moves depend on its gender.",
        "tagline": "A blank-faced kitten barely holding in its psychic power",
        "sources": [
          {
            "title": "Bulbapedia: Espurr (Pokémon)",
            "url": "https://bulbapedia.bulbagarden.net/wiki/Espurr_(Pok%C3%A9mon)"
          }
        ]
      },
      "branches": {
        "text": "Only its gender decides. A male Espurr becomes the dark blue Meowstic, which prefers to protect its allies, and a female becomes the white Meowstic, which is more selfish and aggressive; the two learn different moves.",
        "sources": [
          {
            "title": "Bulbapedia: Meowstic (Pokémon)",
