      "description": {
        "fun": "Meowstic keeps its ears folded down to hold back psychic power that could grind a 10-ton truck to dust, unfurling them only when it means business. The two genders look and act differently: the blue male is a protective support, while the white female is selfish and torments anyone who denies it what it wants. It's modelled on the nekomata, a cat yōkai whose tail splits into two.",
        "guide": "Meowstic is a Psychic-type cat Pokémon that evolves from Espurr. Males are dark blue and defensive, females are white and more aggressive, and each learns different moves. It hides eye-like psychic organs inside its ears, and can Mega Evolve into Mega Meowstic, added in the Mega Dimension DLC for Pokémon Legends: Z-A.",
        "tagline": "A two-tailed psychic cat; the boys protect, the girls torment",
